Package: coxlite
Type: Package
Title: Cox Proportional Hazards Model from Scratch
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Billy", "Block", email = "biblock@umich.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits Cox proportional hazards models for right-censored
    data with a Newton-Raphson implementation of the partial likelihood.
    Handles Breslow and Efron ties, strata and factor covariates, and
    estimates the baseline hazard. The likelihood code is written both in
    R and in C++ (via 'Rcpp'). Gives the same results as survival::coxph().
